WEBVTT

00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:04.150
Does your elbow hurt
after playing padel?

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:07.300
It's an overload of the
forearm tendons

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:09.500
and rest alone
won't cure it

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.750
First I examine the elbow

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:14.500
and do an ultrasound
to see the tendons

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.950
Then, exercise

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:19.000
checking your racket
and technique

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:22.450
and if it doesn't improve,
autologous growth factors

00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:25.700
guided by ultrasound:
what's called PRP

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:28.000
Book your assessment with me
